ves around and  is a part of the living breathing  machine is something that is visible as  well which is something that I think is  very interesting about it not that I  advocate putting the inside of your  mobile phone outside but it's something  that I always thought is quite  interesting about this game punk theme  and maybe what it gets part of its charm  for as well so on the other side anyway  we have this other propeller tower as  well it's not quite as big and I wanted  to find some other ways of actually  putting this alongside the side of the  building so we've got some separate  rails on one side which doesn't make  much sense I still should support it  from the other side but we'll see about  how that's going to work at some point  in the future to be honest I'm not  really too concerned about how this  works properly but in any case we've got  all kinds of moving policies so that's  pretty cool now that's been it for this  episode of four fara so I would like to  thank you guys so much for watching  sorry about my huge monologue of being  tired of this game I definitely am NOT  I'm just trying to wrap up all of my  current stuff and get myself together  and get my [ __ ] together which I'm being  terrible at so I just wanted to vent  that but hopefully we'll be fine in the  end M is what will be finished and  there's a core project to look back at  and some more fun projects to start with  and that's something that I'm really  looking forward to doing since a very  long time so yeah I hope you guys  enjoyed and I'll see you in the next  episode  you  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]
 

